- **Local-speed reads/writes** with intelligent sync
- **Automatic failover** with Consul coordination

## Components

- `cmd/distsqlite/` - Main sidecar binary
- `pkg/vfs/` - SQLite VFS implementation 
- `pkg/lease/` - Consul lease management
